      <guid>https://codelibrary.huwize.com/widget-tricks/custom-tooltips/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;These are resources to create custom tooltips for your maps. You can use them directly &lt;a href=&#34;https://help.opendatasoft.com/platform/en/publishing_data/07_configuring_visualizations/02_configuring_map_view/tooltip.html#custom-html-tooltip&#34;&gt;in the map editor&lt;/a&gt; (in which case you will omit the context) or in your pages.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
